# Social-work ecomap: newly resettled refugee family with resettlement agency, language classes, health care, and cultural community.
ecomap "Hassan Family Resettlement"
  center: family [label: "Hassan Family"]
  agency [label: "Resettlement Agency", category: government, importance: major]
  interpreter [label: "Interpreter", category: community]
  esl [label: "ESL Classes", category: education]
  clinic [label: "Community Health Clinic", category: health]
  mosque [label: "Mosque Community", category: religion]
  employer [label: "New Employer", category: work]
  agency --> family
  interpreter <-> family
  family === esl
  family == clinic
  family === mosque
  family --- employer
